### =====================================
### AUTH - Autenticacao OAuth2
### =====================================

### Obter Token de Acesso
# @name getToken
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "grantType": "client_credentials",
    "clientId": "client_sandbox_Dp9VKwzn5D-Ofl_-KasDCk4RlchlzU4SiCNUNhil-uo",
