### =====================================
### CUSTOMERS - Gerenciamento de Clientes
### =====================================

### Criar Cliente
# @name createCustomer
POST {{host}}/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "externalId": "customer-002",
    "name": "Andre",
    "email": "andre.silva@email.com",
    "document": "12345678901",
    "documentType": "CPF",
    "phone": "5511999999999",
    "metadata": ""
}

### Buscar Cliente por ID
GET {{host}}/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar Clientes
GET {{host}}/v1/customers?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar Clientes com Filtros
GET {{host}}/v1/customers?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Active&search=joao
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar Cliente
PATCH {{host}}/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Andre",
    "email": "joao.novo@email.com",
    "phone": "5511888888888",
    "status": "Active"
}

### =====================================
### TRANSACTIONS - API Unificada de Transacoes
### =====================================

### Criar Transacao PIX
# @name createTransaction
POST {{host}}/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "method": "pix", 
    "amount": 15500,
    "currency": "BRL",
    "description": "Pagamento do pedido #456",
    "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
    "callbackurl": "https://api.seusite.com/webhooks/safefy",
    "pixexpirationminutes": 30,
    "customername": "Joao Silva",
    "customerdocument": "12345678901",
    "customeremail": "joao.silva@email.com"
}

### Criar Transacao PIX (criando Customer automaticamente)
POST {{host}}/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "method": "pix",
    "amount": 15500,
    "currency": "BRL",
    "description": "Pagamento do pedido #456",
    "callbackurl": "https://api.seusite.com/webhooks/safefy",
    "pixexpirationminutes": 30,
    "customername": "Joao Silva",
    "customerdocument": "12345678901",
    "customeremail": "joao.silva@email.com"
}

### Criar Transacao PIX (Minimo)
POST {{host}}/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "method": "pix",
    "amount": 1000
}

### Criar Transacao Cartao de Credito (em breve)
# POST {{host}}/v1/transactions
# Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
#
# {
#     "method": "credit_card",
#     "amount": 15000,
#     "card_token": "tok_abc123",
#     "installments": 3
# }

### Criar Transacao Boleto (em breve)
# POST {{host}}/v1/transactions
# Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
#
# {
#     "method": "boleto",
#     "amount": 25000,
#     "boleto_due_date": "2024-12-31",
