### Listar Transacoes
GET {{host}}/v1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar Transacoes com Filtros
GET {{host}}/v1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20&method=pix&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar Transacoes por Data
GET {{host}}/v1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20&startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar Transacoes por Customer
GET {{host}}/v1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20&customerId={{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar Transacoes por ExternalId
GET {{host}}/v1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20&externalId=order-456
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar Transacao por ID
GET {{host}}/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Simular Transacao - Completar (Sandbox)
POST {{host}}/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "action": "complete"
}

### Simular Transacao - Expirar (Sandbox)
POST {{host}}/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "action": "expire"
}

### Simular Transacao - Falhar (Sandbox)
POST {{host}}/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "action": "fail"
}

### Simular Transacao - Estornar (Sandbox)
# Apenas para transacoes com status completed
POST {{host}}/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "action": "refund"
}

### =====================================
### BALANCE - Saldo e Volumes do Merchant
### =====================================

### Consultar Saldo
# Retorna saldo disponivel, pendente, total e volumes
# Volumes consideram apenas pagamentos com status Completed
GET {{host}}/v1/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
